WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.855
Heavy midnight rain pounds relentlessly upon the ancient and forgotten stone temple rooftop.

2
00:00:05.855 --> 00:00:11.711
Shadowy figures emerge silently from the swirling mist with glowing red assassin blades.

3
00:00:11.711 --> 00:00:17.519
Master Kaito stands motionless against the dark storm while facing his deadly pursuers.

4
00:00:17.519 --> 00:00:22.655
His piercing eyes focus sharply upon the chaotic drops falling from the sky.

5
00:00:22.655 --> 00:00:28.032
Ancient mystical energy surges rapidly through his fingertips into the wet night air.

6
00:00:28.032 --> 00:00:34.344
Falling raindrops instantly freeze solid midair creating an impossible wall of glistening ice.

7
00:00:34.344 --> 00:00:40.152
Shocked dark assassins freeze in utter disbelief at the incredible display of mastery.

8
00:00:40.152 --> 00:00:45.768
Kaito sweeps his blade forward shattering the frozen water into deadly crystal shards.

9
00:00:45.768 --> 00:00:51.456
The defeated shadow enemies dissolve into harmless black smoke beneath the stormy sky.

10
00:00:51.456 --> 00:00:57.504
Silence returns completely to the sacred grounds as the midnight storm finally clears away.
